WEBVTT

00:08:00.476 --> 00:08:06.023
Therefore, there need to be metaverses
available and accessible for everyone.

00:08:06.815 --> 00:08:09.985
Each person that wants to,
I will not force anyone,

00:08:10.027 --> 00:08:13.781
should be able to craft
the metaverse of their dreams

00:08:13.781 --> 00:08:17.201
independent of their situation
in the real world.

00:08:18.786 --> 00:08:22.331
The in-metaverse economy
should not mirror the inequities

00:08:22.373 --> 00:08:23.624
we see in the real world.

00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:26.877
And it’s much more
delightful and inclusive

00:08:26.919 --> 00:08:31.632
if the resources in the metaverse
are part of a fun and fair game system